    SUBROUTINE CIB.DUMP.FT.CIB.CORE

*********************************** AUDIT INFORMATION ********************************
* 1. Author&Date created  : AHMED20260715
* 2. Site name    : CIB
* 3. Product    : POR.TRANSACTION
* 4. Routine type   :
* 5. Installed on   : BATCH
* 6. E.V.B record   :
********************************** PROGRAM DESCRIPTION ********************************
* 7. Description
* --------------
*
*  Extract text file containing data of POR.TRANSACTION + Enrich data
*
* 8. Incoming arguments
* -------------------------------
* a)     :
*
* 9. Outgoing arguments
* -------------------------------
* a)     :
*
**********
* Modification History     Author
* 25-Jun-2018              Ravikant              R18 Upgrade Code Retrofit
